    bool "Heltec WiFi LoRa 32 V3.2 HTIT-WB32LAF"
    default n
    help
        Select the exact Heltec WiFi LoRa 32 V3.2
        HTIT-WB32LAF board mapping.

        This option has no implicit default. The board component
        CMake contract fails the build unless exactly one
        controlled SQD board selection is enabled.

